  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>It is difficult to teleport away from you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Teleport Tactician<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> A foe you strike with Teleport Tactician cannot teleport more than 30 feet away, even if it successfully teleports. You can make the attack for Teleport Tactician even if you are out of attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc116\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
